---
description: Current physical repository is authoritative
alwaysApply: true
---

Current workspace identity overrides inherited chat context and open editor tabs.
Resolve the Git root from cwd or an explicit -C path. A copied NEXT never selects
a repository. Clear inherited action authority after a repository/task change.
Use disposable fixtures for cross-repository tests. No real consumer access is
authorized by the recovery milestone. V1 has no multi-repository orchestration.
